Understand Requirements: Review the project details and objectives.
Test Planning: Create a plan for the testing approach, tools, and timeline.
Test Case Creation: Write detailed test cases based on requirements.
Test Execution: Perform manual or automation testing, documenting results.
Bug Reporting: Report any issues or bugs found during testing.
Regression Testing: Re-test after fixes to ensure no new issues.
Collaboration: Work closely with developers and team members.
Final Reporting: Provide a summary of testing activities and results.
